{"questions":[{"question_id":"1lsgxwd5m","content":"<p>What happens to freezing point of benzene when small quantity of napthalene is added to benzene?</p>","chapter":"solutions","chapterGroup":"physical-chemistry","country":"in","difficulty":"easy","exam":"jee-main","examGroup":"jee","languages":["en","hi"],"marks":4,"negMarks":1,"paperId":"jee-main-2024-online-30th-january-morning-shift","paperTitle":"JEE Main 2024 (Online) 30th January Morning Shift","permalink":"pwhat-happens-to-freezing-point-of-benzene-when-small-quan-jee-main-chemistry-some-basic-concepts-of-chemistry-p0gpaoqrnv0ynvve","question":{"en":{"comprehension":null,"direction":null,"content":"<p>What happens to freezing point of benzene when small quantity of napthalene is added to benzene?</p>","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"Increases\n"},{"identifier":"B","content":"Decreases\n"},{"identifier":"C","content":"Remains unchanged\n"},{"identifier":"D","content":"First decreases and then increases"}],"correct_options":["B"],"answer":null,"explanation":"<p>When a small quantity of naphthalene is added to benzene, the freezing point of benzene decreases. This phenomenon is due to the colligative property known as freezing point depression. The addition of a solute, such as naphthalene, disrupts the orderly arrangement of solvent molecules in the solid phase, thereby lowering the freezing point.</p>\n<p>Mathematically, the decrease in freezing point (<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.667ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.274ex\" height=\"2.287ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -716 1888.9 1011\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"394\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-394\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(833,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D447\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D447\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(617,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D453\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D453\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>) can be represented by the equation:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.667ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16.315ex\" height=\"2.287ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -716 7211.3 1011\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"394\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-394\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(833,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D447\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D447\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(617,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D453\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D453\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2166.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(3222.5,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D456\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D456\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3789.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"22C5\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-22C5\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(4289.9,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D43E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43E\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(882,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D453\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D453\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(5833,0)\"><use data-c=\"22C5\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-22C5\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(6333.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45A\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>where:</p>\n\n<p><p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.781ex\" height=\"1.52ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -661 345 672\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D456\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D456\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is the van't Hoff factor (which is 1 for naphthalene as it does not dissociate in solution),</p></p>\n<p><p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.667ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.988ex\" height=\"2.213ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 1320.9 978\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D43E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43E\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(882,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D453\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D453\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is the cryoscopic constant of the solvent (benzene),</p></p>\n<p><p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.986ex\" height=\"1.025ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 878 453\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D45A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45A\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is the molality of the solution.</p></p>\n\n<p>Thus, the correct option is:</p>\n<p><strong>Option B: Decreases</strong></p>"},"hi":{"direction":null,"comprehension":null,"content":"<p>जब बेन्जीन से थोड़ी मात्रा में नैफ्थलीन मिलायी जाती है तो बेन्जीन के हिमांक पर क्या प्रभाव पड़ता है?</p>","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"बढ़ता है\n"},{"identifier":"B","content":"घटता है\n"},{"identifier":"C","content":"अपरिवर्तित रहता है"},{"identifier":"D","content":"पहले घटता है फिर बढ़ता है"}],"correct_options":["B"],"answer":null,"explanation":"<p>जब बेंजीन में नैफ्थलीन की थोड़ी मात्रा मिलाई जाती है, तो बेंजीन का हिमांक घट जाता है। यह घटना अणुसंख्य गुण के कारण होती है जिसे हिमांक अवनमन कहा जाता है। विलेय, जैसे नैफ्थलीन, की मिलावट ठोस अवस्था में विलायक अणुओं की व्यवस्थित संरचना को विघटित कर देती है, जिससे हिमांक कम हो जाता है।</p>\n<p>गणितीय रूप से, हिमांक में कमी (<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.667ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.274ex\" height=\"2.287ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -716 1888.9 1011\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"394\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-394\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(833,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D447\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D447\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(617,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D453\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D453\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>) को निम्नलिखित समीकरण द्वारा दर्शाया जा सकता है:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.667ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16.315ex\" height=\"2.287ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -716 7211.3 1011\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"394\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-394\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(833,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D447\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D447\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(617,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D453\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D453\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2166.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(3222.5,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D456\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D456\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3789.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"22C5\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-22C5\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(4289.9,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D43E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43E\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(882,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D453\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D453\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(5833,0)\"><use data-c=\"22C5\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-22C5\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(6333.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45A\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>जहाँ:</p>\n\n<p><p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.781ex\" height=\"1.52ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -661 345 672\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D456\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D456\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> वांट हॉफ कारक है (जो नैफ्थलीन के लिए 1 है क्योंकि यह विलयन में वियोजित नहीं होता),</p></p>\n<p><p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.667ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.988ex\" height=\"2.213ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 1320.9 978\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D43E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43E\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(882,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D453\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D453\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> विलायक (बेंजीन) का क्रायोस्कोपिक स्थिरांक है,</p></p>\n<p><p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.986ex\" height=\"1.025ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 878 453\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D45A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45A\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> विलयन की मोललता है।</p></p>\n\n<p>इस प्रकार, सही विकल्प है:</p>\n<p><strong>विकल्प B: घटता है</strong></p>"}},"subject":"chemistry","subjectGroup":null,"timeAllotted":120000,"topic":"depression-in-freezing-point","type":"mcq","year":2024,"isOutOfSyllabus":false,"isBonus":false,"tags":[],"yearKey":"jee-main-2024-online-30th-january-morning-shift","active":true,"options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"Increases\n"},{"identifier":"B","content":"Decreases\n"},{"identifier":"C","content":"Remains unchanged\n"},{"identifier":"D","content":"First decreases and then increases"}],"correct_options":["B"],"explanation":"<p>When a small quantity of naphthalene is added to benzene, the freezing p